# Configuration

# Vault base path - relative (./Brain) or absolute. Edit to point at your vault.
VAULT_BASE_PATH=./Brain

# Where external document insights are stored
DOCUMENT_INSIGHTS_PATH=./Brain/Document Insights

---

## About this file

The repo ships a ready `.claude/settings.md` with exactly the values above, so a
fresh copy works without any setup step (`CLAUDE.md` imports it with
`@.claude/settings.md`). This template is the reference copy of those defaults.

- `settings.md` is tracked, not gitignored: the defaults are relative paths and
  hold nothing personal. Edit it in place to point at another vault.
- To return to the defaults: `cp .claude/settings.md.template .claude/settings.md`
  and delete everything from the `---` line down.
- All agents and skills read `$VAULT_BASE_PATH` from `settings.md`.
- After changing the vault path, rebuild the index: `/refresh-index`
  (or `resources/local-brain-search/run_index.sh`).
- First install (Python search engine, index, daemon): `/first-run`.
